# Task 20 — netConnect with explicit EffectDecl (density v4).
# The EffectDecl must bind the same host/port nodes the application
# consumes (Q-039 projection: ArgRef(0)/ArgRef(1)). Probes
# ProjectionMismatch / EffectDeclParameterTypeMismatch /
# EffectDeclArityMismatch.
@v=1 root=outer
host STR "db.internal"
port ILT 5432
cd EFD connectFx [host port]
callConnect APP netConnect [host port] [] [cd]
addOne APP add [callConnect 1]
handleLam LAM [h:stringT p:intT] 7
outer H connectFx handleLam addOne
